0	section	The cursed crew
0	section	Talking to Captain Tock
1	line	Captain Tock	Ahoy, young [lad/lass]. Might ye be able to help me, perhaps? I be in a spot of bother.
1	option	Who are you?
2	line	Player	Who are you?
2	line	Captain Tock	I be the Corsair Captain! Captain of the Corsairs of Corsair Cove! My gallant band of corsairs are famed in song and story among all seafarers.
2	option	I've never heard of you.
3	line	Player	I've never heard of you.
3	line	Captain Tock	Arrr... well, ye can boast of yer ignorance if ye likes, but it don't make ye sound smarter.
3	line	Player	...
3	line	Captain Tock	Well, as I were saying, young [lad/lass], I be in a spot of bother, and I thought ye might be able to help.
3	action	other
2	option	That's very interesting; do tell me more.
3	line	Player	That's very interesting; do tell me more.
3	line	Captain Tock	Well, as I were saying, young [lad/lass], I be in a spot of bother, and I thought ye might be able to help.
3	action	other
1	option	What kind of help do you need?
2	line	Player	What kind of help do you need?
2	line	Captain Tock	It be about my crew. They be a lazy bunch at times, but they be stout in the heart and strong in the arm, and they don't deserve what's happened to them...
2	line	Captain Tock	It be a curse! A curse has been laid upon my crew! That's the only thing it can be.
2	line	Captain Tock	So I need a young [lad/lass] such as yerself to find a way to lift the curse. Will ye help me?
2	option	Sure, I'll try to help with your curse.
3	line	Player	Sure, I'll try to help with your curse.
3	line	Captain Tock	Arrr! Thanks, young [lad/lass]. And a worthy [lad/lass] ye must surely be, brave in the heart and stiff in the spine.
3	line	Captain Tock	Now, I've a ship moored west of Rimmington. Come and meet me on board, and we'll set off to Corsair Cove.
3	line	Player	West of Rimmington, you say? Okay, I'll meet you on board your ship there.
3	box	Captain Tock swaggers off towards Rimmington.
3	action	end
2	option	No, I'm not available.
3	action	below
1	option	No, I'm not available.
2	line	Player	No, I'm not available.
2	line	Captain Tock	Arrr. Some other time, perhaps...
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Captain Tock again
1	line	Captain Tock	Arrr, ye've found my ship - good [lad/lass]. I used to command a much larger vessel, sailing the seas with my crew of Corsairs, but now we be settled in Corsair Cove.
1	line	Captain Tock	My Corsairs be a good crew, but this curse has laid them low, all except me. Sickly, they be. Too weak to stand. Ye'll see fer yerself soon enough.
1	line	Captain Tock	There be four of 'em afflicted by the curse - Gnocci, Ithoi, Arsen and young Colin. All taken to their beds, a- mewlin' and a-pukin' like so many babbies.
1	line	Captain Tock	I've another crewman, Francois, but he be away on a mission. I hope he be spared!
1	line	Captain Tock	Now be ye ready to voyage to Corsair Cove to help 'em? I can sail ye back here any time ye likes.
1	option	Okay, I'm ready go to Corsair Cove.
2	line	Player	Okay, I'm ready go to Corsair Cove.
2	box	The ship sails to Corsair Cove...
2	action	end
1	option	Not just now, thanks.
2	line	Player	Not just now, thanks.
2	line	Captain Tock	That's fair enough, young [lad/lass], but perhaps ye'll return to help me soon...
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Arsen before talking to Ithoi
