1	option	I hear you've been cursed.
2	line	Player	I hear you've been cursed.
2	line	Arsen the Thief	I think so. That navigator, Ithoi, always warned us that this kind of thing could happen, but I didn't think it could possibly be real. But now this has happened, and I think it's my fault.
2	line	Arsen the Thief	You should maybe see what Ithoi thinks. He's been cursed too, so I guess he'll be in his hut, off to the south-west, near the shore.
2	action	end
1	option	Urgh to you too, with candy sprinkles on.
2	line	Player	Urgh to you too, with candy sprinkles on.
2	line	Arsen the Thief	A sympathetic soul you are. I'm in real pain here.
2	line	Player	Yes, I hear you've been cursed.
2	action	above
