0	section	Talking to Ithoi
1	line	Ithoi the Navigator	Arrr, we be cursed, we be CURSED! It be a curse upon us!
1	option	I hear you've been cursed.
2	line	Player	I hear you've been cursed.
2	line	Ithoi the Navigator	Aye? D'ye think so? Really? Am I not a picture of health an' beauty?
2	line	Ithoi the Navigator	YES - WE'VE BEEN CURSED!
2	line	Ithoi the Navigator	I've sailed the seas all my life. I sailed the seas as a man, like I sailed 'em as a boy.
2	line	Ithoi the Navigator	I even sailed the seas during that tricky phase in between, when ye'r not quite a man yet, but ye'r not really a boy anymore. But I don't want to talk about that bit.
2	line	Player	Um...
2	line	Ithoi the Navigator	The point I'm makin' is that I know the seas like I know the palm of my hand. I've been to strange lands an' seen things that'll make yer juices turn in yer veins.
2	line	Ithoi the Navigator	I've seen dancing fish-women, monkey-kings, huge men in turbans from the far West selling treasure maps - you name it, an' I've seen it.
2	line	Ithoi the Navigator	There be more things in the world than ye dreams of in yer fancy book-learnin'! An' most of 'em be hostile. Could be any number of things brought this curse upon us. Demons, evil spirits, anything!
2	line	Player	Okay, it doesn't sound like you know what's behind the curse. Thanks.
2	line	Ithoi the Navigator	Arrr!
2	action	end
1	option	I think I'll leave you to get on with it.
2	line	Player	I think I'll leave you to get on with it.
2	line	Ithoi the Navigator	... arrr.
2	action	end
