2	line	Chief Tess	Arsen says he's very sorry for stealing from you. Here it is...
2	box	You present Tess with Arsen's loot.
2	line	Chief Tess	Yah, dat little man is big idiot. Climbed down vine, grabbed tooth-pick off Tess and ran away like scared kebbit.
2	line	Player	You're saying this is a tooth-pick? Not a sacred relic of the ogres? Did your shamans curse the Corsairs for stealing it?
2	line	Chief Tess	Dis is tooth-pick. Tess got plenty more. If skinny idiot man want Tess' old tooth-pick, maybe he sick in his head. But Tess not having shamans curse anyone.
2	line	Player	Oh. Well, I guess Arsen will be pleased to hear he didn't bring the curse upon the Corsairs.
