0	section	Returning to Arsen
1	line	Arsen the Thief	Have you returned the sacred relic to the ogres? Will they forgive me and lift the curse?
1	line	Player	Their chief, Tess, says that wasn't a sacred relic at all. It was her tooth-pick.
1	line	Arsen the Thief	Are you telling me the ogres cursed us all because I stole their chief's tooth-pick?
1	line	Player	She didn't care - she's got lots of tooth-picks, and she just thought you were some kind of weirdo when you stole one. They never cursed you at all.
1	line	Arsen the Thief	Oh. That's a relief, I guess. Um... thank you for your help. But I do wonder where the curse really came from.
