0	section	Colin's "curse"
0	section	Talking to Colin
1	line	Cabin Boy Colin	I'm sorry! Tell her I'm sorry! Then maybe she'll make the pain stop...
1	option	I hear you've been cursed.
2	line	Player	I hear you've been cursed.
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	Yes, that's what it must be. Ithoi, the navigator, always told us to beware of curses.
2	line	Player	I've met him. He definitely thinks it's a curse, but wasn't able to say exactly what caused it.
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	This is all my fault. But I didn't mean to upset her. I just thought we could be friends. Now I must have upset her, and she's cursed us all!
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	Ithoi always told us that bad things happen to sailors who get involved with mermaids, but I didn't believe him. I should have listened! But I'll tell you what happened...
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	I was using Ithoi's telescope...
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	Such a beautiful night!
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	What lands lie beyond the dim horizon, I wonder...
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	Eh?
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	What was that? I'd better have another look.
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	Is that what I think it is?
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	It's so dark out there, but I think... ... yes, I'm quite sure...
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	... yes, it's a mermaid! She's beautiful!
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	Hello?
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	Can you hear me?
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	You're the most lovely person I've ever seen!
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	I can see you moving your arms, but it's very dark. Are you waving to me?
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	#0000ff|*kiss*
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	Hello?
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	Oh, no, I think she's gone away. Did I put her off?
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	Maybe she doesn't like strangers shouting about her appearance and blowing kisses at her. That might have been rude of me.
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	I hope she's not angry. Ithoi says mermaids can be dangerous.
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	Perhaps you can find the mermaid and tell her I'm very sorry I was rude to her. Then maybe she'll lift the curse.
2	action	end
1	option	Perhaps you can tell me about it another time.
2	line	Player	Perhaps you can tell me about it another time.
2	line	Cabin Boy Colin	I'll be here. I'm not going anywhere while I feel so sick.
2	action	end
